# Atomic layout inventory (ReadBoot)

**Scope:** **`patterns/` library only** — documents legacy organism→atom wiring. **Greenfield** UI layout and folders = **`readboot-scss-architecture.mdc`** (`tokens/`, `framework/`, `components/`).

**Atom folder types** in `packages/ui/src/patterns/Atoms/`:

| Type | Folders / role |
|------|----------------|
| **Branding** | `Typography`, `Logo`, `Colors` — type, identity, token display |
| **Interactive** | `Button`, `NavigationLink` — clicks, navigation affordances |
| **LayoutAtoms** | `SectionLayout` — grid shells, regions |
| **DisplayAtoms** | `Badge` — small status/chip UI |
| **EnvironmentalAtoms** | `Container` — page / region width |
| **Spatial** | spacing scales, geometric tokens (usually `@use` in SCSS, not always a component) |
| **External (Next)** | `next/image`, `next/link` — wrap or compose; not in `Atoms/` but primitive |

**Layers:** **Template** → stacks **Organisms**. **Organisms** compose **Molecules** (optional today) and **Atoms**. **Molecules** = repeated chunks (card, headline stack, CTA row, timeline rail).

