## `FullBleedHero` (organism)

Newspaper: **open** band, **side-saddle** (portrait + copy).

| Piece | Atomic layer | Atom type (folder) | Today in code |
|-------|----------------|----------------------|----------------|
| Root `<section>` | Organism | — | `FullBleedHero` |
| Portrait frame + image | Organism internals | **Next** (`next/image`) | `Image` in ruled frame |
| Kicker line | Atom candidate | **Branding** (`Typography`) | `<p>` + SCSS |
| Headline | Atom candidate | **Branding** (`Typography`) | `<h1>` + SCSS |
| Deck / subhead | Atom candidate | **Branding** (`Typography`) | `<p>` + SCSS |
| Lead | Atom candidate | **Branding** (`Typography`) | `<p>` + SCSS |
| Primary / secondary CTA | **Atom** | **Interactive** (`Button` + `asChild`) | `Button` + **Next** `Link` |
| Grid / gap / borders | Layout tokens | **Spatial** + **Branding** (colors) | `FullBleedHero.module.scss` |

**Molecules to extract later:** `HeadlineStack` (kicker + h1 + deck), `DualCtaRow` (two buttons).

