## `Showcase` (organism)

Surface + grid + **homogeneous** slots.

| Piece | Atomic layer | Atom type | Today in code |
|-------|----------------|-----------|----------------|
| Section + `SectionLayout` grid | Organism + **Atom** | **LayoutAtoms** | `Showcase` uses `SectionLayout` |
| Per item | **Molecule** | Domain cards | `ProjectCard` or `BlogCard` (not under Atoms — **Molecules/Cards**) |

Card **atom types** inside those molecules: **Branding** (`Typography`, `Badge`), **Interactive** (`Button`, `Link`).

